'' A BRACE LIST OF OBJECTS INTO A POINTER ARRAY stores each one's 'operator cast', as the scalar
'' declaration does. It stopped on TKO0994 ("this N_VAR was not compiled") -- sys/win's
'' '{ strokes }' of ID2D1StrokeStyle wrappers (FINDINGS 5.5d). fbc-modern 1.20 prints 7 9 / 9 7 9.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/mir/src/brace-ptr-cast-run.bas -o tests/mir/braceptrcastrun.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/mir/braceptrcastrun.exe
'' RUN: tests/mir/braceptrcastrun.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7 9
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  9 7 9
